\line
\b\fs26\cf1 6. PROJECT RISK REGISTER (5 MAJOR RISKS)\b0\fs20\cf0\par
\b R-01: Cold-Start & Inaccurate Match\b0\par
- Category: Technical / AI Engine | P: 4 | I: 4 | \b Score: 16 (Critical)\b0\par
- Mitigation: Enforce onboarding requirement of 3 baseline skills; hybrid keyword/vector matching.\par
- Contingency: Domain-based broad fallbacks and missing skill alerts. Owner: Abel Mathew Bose.\par
\par
\b R-02: Profile Evidence Fabrication\b0\par
- Category: Data Integrity & Trust | P: 3 | I: 5 | \b Score: 15 (High)\b0\par
- Mitigation: Automated repo regex verification, domain whitelisting, and mandatory checkpoint testing.\par
- Contingency: Missing proof badges; restrict recruiter pipeline visibility. Owner: Sidharth K.A.\par
\par
\b R-03: Client-Side Latency & UI Freezing\b0\par
- Category: Performance & Scalability | P: 3 | I: 3 | \b Score: 9 (Medium)\b0\par
- Mitigation: Debounce radar triggers, async vector computations, and opportunity caching.\par
- Contingency: Disable radar sweep animations on low-spec clients; pagination. Owner: Sen Shaji.\par
\par
\b R-04: Scope Creep Across Dual Portals\b0\par
- Category: Schedule & Milestones | P: 4 | I: 3 | \b Score: 12 (High)\b0\par
- Mitigation: Strict milestone boundaries (Student Core first, Recruiter features in Phase 2).\par
- Contingency: Feature freeze on non-essential UI; pairing on radar & assessment. Owner: K.M. Meenakshi.\par
\par
\b R-05: Assessment Test Fatigue\b0\par
- Category: User Adoption & Retention | P: 3 | I: 4 | \b Score: 12 (High)\b0\par
- Mitigation: 5-minute modular checkpoints, real-time progress bars, and streak counters.\par
- Contingency: Auto-save in localStorage with non-intrusive reminder alerts. Owner: K.M. Meenakshi.\par
\line
\b\fs26\cf1 7. CONCLUSION\b0\fs22\cf0\par
The Work Breakdown Structure, Gantt chart, and Risk Register for CareerPilot AI were successfully planned, verified, and exported into Microsoft Excel and Word document formats meeting all requirements of Experiment No. 03.\par
